Well, the message was supposed to be the first message in the stoning
process, so it gives you five turns.
Teleport the mother-in-law away from you. During this turn the green
slime will probably move to the space 2 squares away from you.
Zap the wand of lightning to hit the slime twice.
If the slime hasn't moved, move next to it.
Attack it; you should be able to kill it in one hit.
Eat the corpse; the first bite will cure your stoning; the sliming
counter will start by the last bite.
Hop onto the fire trap to burn off the slime, and leave.



